<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-SACRAMENTO WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 1,500 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-SACRAMENTO WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 1,500 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Carla Sacramento won the world women's 1,500 metres title on Tuesday.</p>
<p>American Regina Jacobs took the silver and Anita Weyermann of Switzerland the bronze.</p>
</text>
